Maybe a chance for the essential games list.

00:58:03.820 --> 00:58:11.000
Because usually with the essential games list, you look at the games that are on there and you say, okay, well, it's not better than this.

00:58:11.080 --> 00:58:13.120
So why would it also be on this list?

00:58:13.120 --> 00:58:18.140
But when games like Marble Madness pop up, you're like, well, there's really nothing to grade this against.

00:58:19.480 --> 00:58:22.720
And I think that's something that's really cool about this type of game.

00:58:22.740 --> 00:58:24.380
